plies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1792969342029640095":{"a":"<p>Great thread! &quot;Who would you call?&quot; is the perfect lesson to learn. Buddy, nobody is coming to save you. The police are there to do an inventory for the court. <a href=\"https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1792894085549719693\">Tweet by @JesseForIndy</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1792894085549719693\">https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1792894085549719693</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1792969342029640095</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1792969342029640095\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-21T17:22:57Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1792969890758008946":{"a":"<p>Protect and Serve doesn&#x27;t mean what Y&#x27;all think it means. Protect refers to the equal protection clause that legalized police in the US. Serve means to serve warrants.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1792969342029640095\">https://x.com/i/status/1792969342029640095</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1792969890758008946</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1792969890758008946\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-21T17:25:08Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1792971551412793823":{"a":"<p>The equal protection clause requires police to effectively treat the criminal and the victim equally so evidence is not biased. Police were originally conceived to drive undesirables from the city center. A job they still enjoy. They simply created laws that were biased instead.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1792969890758008946\">https://x.com/i/status/1792969890758008946</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1792971551412793823</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1792971551412793823\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-21T17:31:44Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1792974189915197515":{"a":"<p>Now, the person who is SUPPOSED to be serving warrants and enforcing the law is the county/parish sheriff in the US. Why? This is an elected position. The deputies are accountable directly to voters. So think hard why they created police who often answer to no one in many cases.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1792969890758008946\">https://x.com/i/status/1792969890758008946</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1792974189915197515</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1792974189915197515\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-21T17:42:13Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1792975265187975450":{"a":"<p>@JesseForIndy @creid815 @TheJamesSCook The police don&#x27;t see trying to hit someone with a car as violence.  They don&#x27;t see a lot of things they need to see.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1791888121459589604\">https://x.com/i/status/1791888121459589604</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1791888121459589604\">https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1791888121459589604</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1792975265187975450</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1792975265187975450\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-21T17:46:29Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\